<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Silgan started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Silgan started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Silgan Holdings Inc and added the stock to its recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Silgan gained one to 23-1/4 in morning trading.</p>
